      {
       "id": "0c9399be",
       "elType": "widget",
       "widgetType": "text-editor",
       "settings": {
        "editor": "<p style=\"margin:0;max-width:615px;\">Working with Cure Marine was one of those projects that genuinely blurred the line between work and play.</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-top:20px;max-width:615px;\">As a Sunshine Coast video production company, we are always chasing projects that allow us to combine strong visual storytelling with unforgettable locations. Filming aboard the Cure 55 carbon catamaran delivered exactly that.</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-top:20px;max-width:615px;\">Our team spent several full days on the water capturing premium video content that reflected the craftsmanship, performance and lifestyle behind the Cure Marine brand. From early starts at Mooloolaba Beach through to long sails up the coastline toward Coolum, every moment was designed to showcase these luxury vessels in their natural environment.</p>",
        "text_color": "#55575C",
        "typography_typography": "custom",
        "typography_font_family": "Montserrat",
        "typography_font_size": {
         "unit": "px",
         "size": 16
        },
        "typography_line_height": {
         "unit": "px",
