     "id": "0e44abcc",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "text-editor",
     "settings": {
      "editor": "<p style=\"margin:0;max-width:615px;\">This project required a balance of creative storytelling and technical precision. Our Sunshine Coast videographers captured cinematic drone footage that showcased the scale and performance of the Cure 55 under sail, paired with lifestyle visuals that reflected the experience of being on board.</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-top:20px;max-width:615px;\">Filming along the Sunshine Coast coastline from Mooloolaba to Coolum allowed us to produce high end marine video content that feels both aspirational and authentic. With ideal sailing conditions across multiple shoot days, we were able to deliver smooth, dynamic visuals designed to support Cure Marine’s marketing and sales channels.</p>",
      "text_color": "#55575C",
      "typography_typography": "custom",
      "typography_font_family": "Montserrat",
